From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 01:04:38 +0000
Subject: spi: sun6i: add dual and quad mode support for the H616

The H616 SPI controllers are bound through the "allwinner,sun8i-h3-spi"
fallback, whose configuration advertises no dual or quad modes. The
H616 user manual (v1.0, 9.3.3.7/9.3.3.8 and the SPI_BCC register at
0x38) documents the same dual (DRM, bit 28) and quad (Quad_EN, bit 29)
controls that the driver already programs for the R329/D1, while
keeping the H3-style clock divider register (SPI_CCR at 0x24).

Add an H616 configuration that combines the H3 clock control with the
dual and quad mode bits, matched on the existing
"allwinner,sun50i-h616-spi" compatible, so SPI NOR flashes can use
1-1-2 and 1-1-4 reads where the board wires the extra data lines.
The DT binding already lists this compatible.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/spi/spi-sun6i.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/spi/spi-sun6i.c b/drivers/spi/spi-sun6i.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/spi/spi-sun6i.c
+++ b/drivers/spi/spi-sun6i.c
@@ -778,6 +778,12 @@ static const struct sun6i_spi_cfg sun8i_h3_spi_cfg = {
 	.has_clk_ctl	= true,
 };
 
+static const struct sun6i_spi_cfg sun50i_h616_spi_cfg = {
+	.fifo_depth	= SUN8I_FIFO_DEPTH,
+	.has_clk_ctl	= true,
+	.mode_bits	= SPI_RX_DUAL | SPI_TX_DUAL | SPI_RX_QUAD | SPI_TX_QUAD,
+};
+
 static const struct sun6i_spi_cfg sun50i_r329_spi_cfg = {
 	.fifo_depth	= SUN8I_FIFO_DEPTH,
 	.mode_bits	= SPI_RX_DUAL | SPI_TX_DUAL | SPI_RX_QUAD | SPI_TX_QUAD,
@@ -786,6 +792,7 @@ static const struct sun6i_spi_cfg sun50i_r329_spi_cfg = {
 static const struct of_device_id sun6i_spi_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun6i-a31-spi", .data = &sun6i_a31_spi_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun8i-h3-spi",  .data = &sun8i_h3_spi_cfg },
+	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-spi", .data = &sun50i_h616_spi_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-r329-spi", .data = &sun50i_r329_spi_cfg },
 	/*
 	 * A523's SPI controller has a combined RX buffer + FIFO counter
